+and the match is at least `GLM53_TF_LOOKUP_MIN` tokens long (default 4), and only when the lookup's expected
+committed tokens per millisecond (the timed verify windows and a running acceptance per match length, from a
+cautious prior) beat those of the request's recent MTP / DFlash2 rounds; otherwise the round drafts as before.
